OL,3,AUS borrowing costs hit highest level
OL,4,Asince 2007
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS government borrowing costs climbed
OL,7,Fto their highest level since 2007 after
OL,8,Fa jump in oil prices further fuelled
OL,9,Fconcerns about inflation.
OL,11,FThe effective interest rate on US
OL,12,Fgovernment bonds over 10 years, known
OL,13,Fas the 10-year Treasury yield, rose as
OL,14,Fhigh as 5.04% but has eased back since.
OL,16,FGovernment bond yields have been rising
OL,17,Fglobally for months, driven by worries
OL,18,Fthat inflation caused by the oil price
OL,19,Fsurge since the start of the US-Israel
OL,20,Fwar with Iran will lead to higher
OL,21,Finterest rates.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
