OL,3,AUS borrowing costs hit highest level
OL,4,Asince 2007
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has been buying back bonds in a
OL,7,Fbid to drive the Treasury yield down,
OL,8,Fwith Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent
OL,9,Fcalling the intervention "successful".
